  "abstract": "Hybrid of oscillatory SSM (specialist) and per-factor low-frequency trend (generalist) with input-adaptive mixing m[b,k]. Tests two changes: V column-normalization for invariance and increased proj_rank p=36. Uses AdamW (wd=1e-4) and MAE+curvature loss.",
